<title>USA: Reliance Steel acquires  Siskin Steel.</title>
<headline>Reliance Steel acquires  Siskin Steel.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reliance Steel &amp; Aluminum Co said Monday it has agreed to acquire 100 percent of privately held  Siskin Steel &amp; Supply Co Inc.</p>
<p>Reliance said in a statement it will pay $71 million in cash for the Chattanooga, Tenn.-based metals service center company. The deal is set to close on October 10.</p>
<p>Siskin's revenues for the fiscal year ended June 30, 1996, were about $151 million. Siskin will operate as a wholly owned subsidiary of Reliance.</p>
</text>
